{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/07/9925096/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あじさいの花を見つけました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう、そんな季節なんだなーって、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふと思って、嬉しくなりました(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"爽やかな季節ですね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/07/9925096/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/07/9925096/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/07/9925096/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もふー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな日は、窓を思いっきり開けて、お日さまの光に、くるくるくるまれながらお昼寝したくなっちゃう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ、最近、入浴剤にはまってます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色んな入浴剤を集めて、毎日違うの入れて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長風呂するのがすっごく好きです( ´ω ` )○°"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとはね、お洗濯も好きだよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一人暮らしをするようになって、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色んなこと学んでいる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にゃんさゆは、生活感がないとよく言われちゃうんだけど、意外と家事は器用にこなすのです(๑•ૅω•´๑)！えへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただ、洗濯機がぐががががって回っていると、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだかこわくて眠れない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"***"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問回答いきます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/07/9925096/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、お手紙の質問にこたえます(*^_^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/07/9925096/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/07/9925096/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○さゆにゃんて何でそんなにカワイイの！？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんわか優しいフンイキでいつも会う度に癒されるんだよネ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いえいえっそんなぁ(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、とっても嬉しいです...有難う"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/07/9925096/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/07/9925096/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○戦隊もの以外に好きな漫画はありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"侵略！イカ娘、銀魂、ケロロ軍曹、夏目友人帳とかかなぁ...。(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近好きなのは、「日常」っていう漫画です。NHKで、テレビアニメも放送されていて本当に面白いです！オススメです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○地元埼玉で好きな場所ってありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は...山の奥に住んでいたので...（笑）実は、埼玉でも知らないことが沢山あって...(^_^;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"森から外の世界を知らなくて、こっちに出てきてから色々知りました（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、埼玉は本当にいいところです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きな場所は、沢山あります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川とかは、泳げるくらいキレイだしお水も美味しいんですよ！(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、電車は一本逃すと一時間以上は待たないとだから気を付けてね！（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○さゆにゃんに会いたいから、握手会に沢山参加してもいいかなぁ？あまり沢山来られると迷惑かな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私のこと、気遣ってくれて有難う(>_<)でも、全然そんなことないんだよ。すっごく嬉しいし、わざわざ会いにきてくれたり、頑張れって言ってくれたりすると、本当に元気がでます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな皆さんには、私も何度だって有難うって言いたいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お手紙もコメントもいつも有難う＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんは、私の正義です＾＾"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほくほく。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからね、あんね、うーんとね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー、寝る！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/07/9925096/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねむねむ。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も、読んでくださって有難うございました(｡´･ω･)｡´_ _)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさゆにゃん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/07/9925096/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/07/9925096/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/07/9925096/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんヽ(｡･ω･｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/07/9925096/0010.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}